# =============================================================================
# Evento Global — optional local overrides (template only; never commit .env)
# =============================================================================
# This app is a static SPA: no backend, no API keys, no Swagger.
# Vite exposes ONLY variables prefixed with VITE_ into the browser bundle.
# Treat every VITE_* value as public. Do not put secrets in VITE_*.
#
# Copy:  cp .env.example .env
# =============================================================================

